docs {
  ### Create Order
  Places a new order based on either a Gig package or a Job proposal.
  Buyer ID is strictly extracted from the authenticated user token.
  
  #### Request Fields (Gig Sourced)
  - `source`: `"gig"`
  - `gig` (UUID, required)
  - `package` (string, required): `"basic"`, `"standard"`, `"premium"`, or `"custom"`
  - `amount` (integer, optional, default: 1)
  - `description` (string, optional)
  - `note` (string, optional)
  
  #### Request Fields (Job Sourced)
  - `source`: `"job"`
  - `job` (UUID, required)
  - `proposal` (UUID, required)
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "status": "pending",
      "code": "G2606240030B",
      "buyer": "uuid-string",
      "seller": "uuid-string",
      "gig": "uuid-string",
      "package": "basic",
      "source": "gig",
      "total_price": 50,
      "title": "Build NestJS Backend",
      "amount": 1,
      "deadline": "2026-06-26T00:30:00.000Z",
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z"
    },
    "message": "Order placed successfully"
  }
  ```
}
